[ti:Tonight Is Ours to Keep]
[la:EN]

[00:11.06]We came in with nothing
[00:13.70]But a half-formed plan
[00:16.72]A room full of strangers
[00:19.54]And time on our hands
[00:22.38]You laughed at the first try
[00:24.86]I said, “Maybe again”
[00:27.70]Somewhere between the chaos
[00:30.54]We started making sense

[00:34.46]We don’t know where this goes
[00:37.32]But I don’t wanna leave just yet
[00:40.62]Stay up a little longer
[00:43.50]We’re closer than we were
[00:46.02]Maybe we won’t change the world
[00:47.94]But maybe that’s not what this is for
[00:52.04]We found a spark in the noise
[00:54.26]A reason to believe
[00:56.86]If tomorrow pulls us different ways
[00:59.86]Tonight is ours to keep

[01:14.60]Cold coffee on the table
[01:17.42]Blue light in your eyes
[01:20.26]We broke it, then we fixed it
[01:23.14]At least a hundred times
[01:26.14]No one had the answers
[01:28.80]But no one walked away
[01:31.62]And somehow all the wrong turns
[01:33.88]Still brought us to this place

[01:38.38]We don’t know where this goes
[01:41.22]But I don’t wanna leave just yet
[01:44.52]Stay up a little longer
[01:47.40]We’re closer than we were
[01:49.91]Maybe we won’t change the world
[01:51.85]But maybe that’s not what this is for
[01:55.95]We found a spark in the noise
[01:58.13]A reason to believe
[02:00.75]If tomorrow pulls us different ways
[02:03.73]Tonight is ours to keep

[02:29.31]Maybe years from now
[02:31.27]I won’t remember every line
[02:34.13]But I’ll remember this room
[02:36.59]And how it felt that night
[02:40.65]When something barely started
[02:45.25]Suddenly felt alive

[02:49.83]Stay up a little longer
[02:52.75]Look how far we’ve come
[02:55.05]We took a room of maybes
[02:57.71]And turned them into something
[03:01.29]We found a spark in the noise
[03:03.43]And let it lead the way
[03:06.07]If tomorrow pulls us different ways
[03:08.93]We still made this today

[03:12.81]The lights go down
[03:15.63]The doors close slow
[03:19.03]But something we made
[03:22.83]Still goes
